# Don’t break working play

Live play (`/e/{code}`, `app/actions/game.ts`, `components/game/`, `lib/grid/game-state.ts`) is tested on phone + desktop. A path the user already signed off is **done**.

## Do

- Fix the reported bug with the **smallest** change
- Keep the existing write path (especially the direct `teams.game_state` update after a correct solve)
- Add fields or copy on screens that already sync to every device

## Do not

- Insert new server round-trips or FSM steps in front of a working solve/OK/sync
- Switch a working update onto `persistPlayingGameState` (version filter can no-op and return old state as success)
- Rebuild give-up, quiz reveal, bonus, or lobby start while fixing something else
- Ask the user to re-test steps they already closed

If a new step is truly required, land it **beside** the working path (same write, extra fields) — never by replacing the write that already reached every device.
